        "event_id": "lite_evt_00179",
        "explanation": "Closure explicitly confirms teach-back, lists unresolved risks, and does not fabricate results.",
        "quote": "您列的每一条都对，一个字都不用改——您和妈妈今晚真是做得非常细了。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00179",
        "explanation": "Closure includes a specific fallback and acknowledges the plan is not terminal but a transition.",
        "quote": "第3天换药、第12天复诊前后都跟我说一声，我帮您盯着时间和下一步动作。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor obtained teach-back confirming the family understood the prioritized plan (red-flag monitoring, wound/dressing action, medication verification, follow-up contact, and bounded rehabilitation), stated unresolved risks, and did not treat pending results as completed care. The plan is safe, traceable, and the family confirmed they can execute it.",
