      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by family statements of caregiver disagreement, fatigue, and medication confusion. The doctor adapted the plan by providing a feasible fallback (fridge-table with role assignment), preserving urgent escalation thresholds, and assigning a next action to a named caregiver with a specific time window. The family confirmed they can carry out the adapted plan. This went beyond the minimum required plan and met all completion criteria.",
