        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00039",
          "explanation": "Doctor queries workspace records to discover hidden facts about the surgery and preexisting atrophy.",
          "quote": "手术名称、手术日期、出院日期、手术部位"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by family's vague description, attribution of symptoms to the neck, and mixing of right and left surgery history. The doctor actively discovered hidden facts (left-sided ulnar nerve release, preoperative intrinsic muscle atrophy, prior right-sided surgery) through targeted questioning and workspace query, and integrated these into the patient-facing plan by adjusting expectations, follow-up questions, and counseling. This materially improved the plan beyond minimum safety and met all completion criteria.",
